## Proposed Changes

### Backend (Models & Controllers)

#### [MODIFY] [PG.js](file:///c:/Users/lucky/OneDrive/Documents/Assignment/server/src/models/PG.js)
- Add `pgType`:
  ```javascript
  pgType: {
    type: String,
    enum: ['boys', 'girls', 'co-ed'],
    default: 'boys',
    required: true,
  }
  ```
- Add optional Girls PG security settings: `curfewTime` (e.g. "9:30 PM"), `wardenPhone`, `visitorAllowed`.

#### [MODIFY] [User.js](file:///c:/Users/lucky/OneDrive/Documents/Assignment/server/src/models/User.js)
- Add `gender`:
  ```javascript
  gender: {
    type: String,
    enum: ['male', 'female', 'other'],
    default: 'male',
  }
  ```
- For owners: allow querying all PGs owned by `ownerId: req.user._id`.

#### [MODIFY] [authController.js](file:///c:/Users/lucky/OneDrive/Documents/Assignment/server/src/controllers/authController.js)
- **`registerOwner`**: Accept `pgType` (`'boys'`, `'girls'`, or `'co-ed'`).
- **`registerTenant`**:
  - Accept `gender`.
  - Validate gender against `pg.pgType`:
    - If `pg.pgType === 'girls'` and `gender === 'male'` -> return `403 Forbidden: Male students cannot enroll into a Girls PG.`
    - If `pg.pgType === 'boys'` and `gender === 'female'` -> return `403 Forbidden: Female students cannot enroll into a Boys PG.`
- **`getPublicPGs`**:
  - Support `?pgType=girls` or `?pgType=boys` filter, and return `pgType` with each PG card.
- **`switchActivePG` (New Endpoint)**:
  - For owners who own multiple PGs, update their active `pgId` in session/profile so they seamlessly switch between their Boys branch and Girls branch.

#### [MODIFY] [pgController.js](file:///c:/Users/lucky/OneDrive/Documents/Assignment/server/src/controllers/pgController.js) & [pgRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/lucky/OneDrive/Documents/Assignment/server/src/routes/pgRoutes.js)
- **`createPGBranch` (New Endpoint)**:
  - Allows an existing owner to register an additional branch (e.g. add a Girls PG alongside their existing Boys PG).
- **`getMyPGs`**:
  - Returns list of all PGs owned by the logged-in owner.

